This repository contains build scripts, a small launcher and Perl module loader,
an Android library and tests, licensed under the Artistic License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The files it builds and ships are other people's work:

* biber (https://github.com/plk/biber), by François Charette and Philip Kime,
  under the Artistic License 2.0.

* Perl (https://www.perl.org) and the CPAN distributions biber depends on, each
  under its own licence, mostly "the same terms as Perl itself" (the Artistic
  License or the GNU GPL).

* Termux's builds of Perl, libxml2, zlib and libiconv
  (https://github.com/termux/termux-packages), under the licences of those
  projects: Perl's terms, MIT, the zlib licence and the GNU LGPL 2.1 or later.

None of their source is changed. They are downloaded at build time, checked
against the SHA-256 sums in pins.txt and scripts/cpan-pins.sha256, and are not
part of this repository. THIRD_PARTY.md lists every component with its version,
licence and source. Each release carries the full notices (NOTICES.txt) and the
complete source of everything it ships (biberdroid-<version>-sources.tar).

The test fixtures in tests/fixtures were made with biblatex 3.21 and the official
biber 2.21 binary.

This project is not affiliated with the biber, biblatex, Perl or Termux projects.
